  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1: HDR (Radiance) and OpenEXR codecs; 12-bit and lossless JPEG decoding; JPEG trellis quantization and quantization presets; BigTIFF writing; IPTC and Photoshop resources; streaming row-by-row Image.Transcode for PNG and JPEG; managed vector paths, brushes, gradients and font text; tone mapping, 3D LUTs, denoise, smart crop, watermarks, dominant colors, placeholder hashes and quality metrics; ICC conversion on load; pooled memory allocators and telemetry; SIMD WebP and document kernels. See CHANGELOG.md.",
